  "source_kind": "retained source-bound inventories; no fresh dependency resolution",
  "analysis": "An SNI TLS server can fall back to a permissive default context on a fragmented ClientHello. Bypass of mutual TLS additionally requires the advisory's permissive-default and missing-secondary-check conditions. The client-side Mod has no direct Netty references in its source/build declarations and does not bundle Netty; game and build dependencies can still use the vulnerable handler. Neither absence of direct Mod references nor game ownership proves non-reachability.",
  "remediation": "Netty upstream lists 4.1.137.Final or 4.2.17.Final respectively. Runtime versions are game-managed; request compatible game/launcher remediation. Investigate build-scope origin and compatibility separately before proposing an override. No replacement, fixed finding, accepted risk or independent approval is claimed.",
  "risk_accepted": false,
  "independent_review": "PENDING",
